  BiosCallsHelp_Begin()
  BiosCallsHelp_L("70 Get/set redirection status")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("More functions")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Beside these MSX-DOS functions also the Basic routines RDSLT (000C), WRSLT (0014), CALSLT (001C),")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("ENASLT (0024) and CALLF (0030) are available. If you call one of these routines please ensure that")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("the stack-area remains valid. Calling a rom routine switches page 0 (0000-3FFF).")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("If - during this time - an interrupt occurs probably page 1 (4000-7FFF) will be switched too.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("It's safe and common to set the stackpointer during program initialisation to the top of")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("available memory. To do so the bytes 6 and 7 can be used:")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("LD   SP,(0006)")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("If you change the stackpointer in this way its not possible to use RET to return from your")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("program. In this case the MSX-DOS function " + Chr(34) + "System Reset" + Chr(34) + " has to be used:")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("LD   C,0")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("JP   0005")
  BiosCallsHelp_Commit("Get/set redirection status", "BDOS")

  BiosCallsHelp_Begin()
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Expanded BIOS hook was designed to expand BIOS (then why it has a so")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("strange name?? X-D) in order to manage new devices. So it is used for")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("example by RS-232 and DOS 2 mapper support routines. Nowadays, also TSR")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("programs (MemmMan, NestorAcentos...) use it, because it provides a fixed")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("memory location to CALL in page 3.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("How it works? You put a device ID number in register D, a function")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("number in register E, and registers AF, BC, HL depending of the calling")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("routine (you can't use alternative registers, nor indexed ones). DE is")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("always preserved when returning; AF, BC, DE depends on the calling")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("routine; alternative and indexed are corrupted.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("To use the extended BIOS, the program should test " + Chr(34) + "HOKVLD" + Chr(34) + " flag at FB20h ")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("in  page-3. If  bit-0 (LSB)  is 0,  there is  no extended BIOS nor the mapper ")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("support. Otherwise,  " + Chr(34) + "EXTBIO" + Chr(34) + " entry (see below) has been set up and it can be ")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("called  with various  parameters. Note  that this test is unnecessary for the ")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("applications which  are based on MSX-DOS (such as the program which is loaded ")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("from the disk), and the program may proceed to the next step.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Next,  the  program  sets  the  device  number of  the extended  BIOS in ")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("register D,  the function  number in  register E,  and required parameters in ")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("other  registers, and  then calls  " + Chr(34) + "EXTBIO" + Chr(34) + " at FFCAh in page-3. In this case, ")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("the stack  pointer must  be in  page-3. If there is the extended BIOS for the ")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("specified  device number,  the contents  of the  registers AF,  BC and HL are ")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("modified according  to the  function; otherwise, they are preserved. Register ")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("DE  is  always  preserved.  Note  that  in  any  cases  the  contents  of the ")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("alternative registers (AF', BC', DE' and HL') and the index registers (IX and ")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("IY) are corrupted.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Device number (register D) | Device")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("00 | RS-232 BIOS")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("01 | RS-232 BIOS")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("04 | Memory mapper-support of MSX-DOS 2")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("0A | MSX-Audio")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("10 | Kanji Driver")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("22 | NestorAcentos, NestorCDPlayer and all TSRs which name is Nestor*.*")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("34 | MWMPLAY by Ramones")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("4D | MemMan")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("F0 | MGSDRV")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("It is recommended that once selected, you use always this number in your")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("programs, modifying register E for every program. For example")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("DE=#2200 for NestorAcentos, and DE=#2201 for NestorCDPlayer.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Now you must patch hook #FFCA, of course saving previous value. The")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("new jump routine must do this:")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Check D. If it does not match with your ID number, jump to the old")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("hook without any register modified.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("If it matches, check register E for required function, do anything and")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("return preserving DE.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("This jump routine should be placed in page 3 if the program is a TSR.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("How to reserve memory on page 3 is another question.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("See also:")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("RAM-Variables (EXTBIO, HOKVLD)")
  BiosCallsHelp_Commit("MSX-BIOS: EXTBIO", "EXTBIO")

  BiosCallsHelp_Begin()
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Section 5 MSX-JE")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Chapter 1 What is MSX-JE?")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Chapter 2 How to Boot MSX-JE")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Chapter 3 How to Use MSX-JE")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Chapter 4 Virtual Terminal Interface")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Chapter 5 Cautions upon Using MSX-JE")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("This page contains a document concerning")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("how an MSX with a kanji input system installed accepts inputs")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("and turns them into fonts (Japanese language utilizes multiple")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("kinds of character sets in order to scribe itself) you prefer")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("to write.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("This relatively large document was")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("originally authored for Japanese readers (which can naturally")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("understand Japanese language) who want to introduce kanji input")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("sequences integrated in their software.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("However, this part is inevitable for")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("development of true emulators.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Up until now, no one has emulated renbunsetsu henkan (sequential")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("bunsetsu conversion). This info might help such developers too.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("And this document describes procedures")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("and effects a boot of MSX-JE system, therefore giving you clues")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("to successfully reverse-engineer Japanese software of recent release,")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("which occasionally use CALL KANJI statement or similar means to")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("boot MSX-JE and enter kanji input mode.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Definitions")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("* Zenkaku and hankaku")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L(Chr(34) + "zen" + Chr(34) + " means")
  BiosCallsHelp_L(Chr(34) + "whole" + Chr(34) + ", " + Chr(34) + "han" + Chr(34) + " means " + Chr(34) + "half" + Chr(34) + ", while")
  BiosCallsHelp_L(Chr(34) + "kaku" + Chr(34) + " means for " + Chr(34) + "square" + Chr(34) + " in Japanese. In")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("MSX or in any word processing related with computers, hankaku")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("is an adjective to describe 1-byte characters (English alphabets,")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("numbers, western punctuation, unaccented katakanas, Japanese punctuation,")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Japanese accents; MSX supports unaccented hiraganas, unlike PC)")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("while zenkaku, " + Chr(34) + "2-byte" + Chr(34) + " characters, include all hiraganas")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("and katakanas, both accented and unaccented, English alphabets,")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("special pictograms like large circles and measurement terms, Greek")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("and Russian fonts, and thousands of kanjis.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("* Bunsetsu and candidate")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L(Chr(34) + "bun" + Chr(34) + " stands")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("for " + Chr(34) + "paragraph" + Chr(34) + " or " + Chr(34) + "sentence" + Chr(34) + ", while " + Chr(34) + "setsu" + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("is a segment. In word-processing sense, this indicates one specific")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("domain in one input which is waiting to be converted. MSX guesses")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("how many characters in one input string is best to convert into")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("any kanji string MSX knows. MSX treats that part of a input as")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("1 " + Chr(34) + "bunsetsu" + Chr(34) + ", and thinks up several " + Chr(34) + "candidates" + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("or " + Chr(34) + "candidates" + Chr(34) + " it thinks best to replace the kanas")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("in bunsetsu, and show them to you, and let you to select the one")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("he or she wanted to write. You can manually adjust length or location")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("of bunsetsu coverage (i.e. from what character a bunsetsu begins")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("and at what character it ends; referred to as candidate block")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("in this document) if you want to, through manipulation with keyboard.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("When you finally get the kanji+kanas proposal from MSX which satisfy")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("you, you press RETURN, and MSX-JE sends the converted bunsetsu")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("to MSX as actual finalized data. Then MSX-JE guesses where next")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("bunsetsu it must convert correspond to what part of input.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Section 5 MSX-JE")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Here we describe MSX Standard Japanese")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Input Front End Processor, commonly called MSX-JE.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("I would like to mention that I referred")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("to VJE-80A Specifications; 2nd Edition (from ASCII Corp.) while")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("authorizing these resources.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Chapter 1 What is MSX-JE?")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L(Chr(34) + "Japanese input front end processor" + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("includes means to input Japanese with word processors, how to")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("do so, and programs which control such procedures. Before coming")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("of MSX-JE as standard, every word processors had their own Japanese")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("input front end processors. This was fine in old days, but in")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("these cases, let's say, when you want your modem connection software")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("to support Japanese input, you must make your own Japanese input")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("front end processor by yourself. However, this is a tremendous")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("amount of work. Moreover, this costs users, who have to learn")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("how to use different kind of Japanese front end processor each")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("time they acquire another software. It's naturally convenient")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("if you could use same input system with your modem connection")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("software, and with your word processor. Therefore, a standard")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("was established concerning means to input Japanese, and how to")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("call them from programs. This is the, " + Chr(34) + "MSX Standard Japanese")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Input Front End Processor" + Chr(34) + " or " + Chr(34) + "MSX-JE" + Chr(34) + " (commonly")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("called MJE).")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("For example, once you have registered")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("a term into internal SRAM while using Bunsho Sakuzaemon, a word")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("processor software on your Sony HB-F1XDJ, you can use that term")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("in occasions you conduct kanji input with kanji BASIC (during")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("CALL KANJI status), too. And also usable when you are using modem")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("through Canon's modem connection cartridge VM-300. Kanji conversion")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("method is standardized as one, too.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Chapter 2 How to Boot MSX-JE")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Use expanded BIOS call, as usual,")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("in order to use MSX-JE.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Firstly, you need to check whether")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("you are able to use expanded BIOS call or not. If lowest bit in")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("address FB20H of the work area is standing, and value of FFCAH")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("is other than C9H, expanded BIOS call is possible. If these conditions")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("are not met, it means there are no machines which rely on expanded")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("BIOS calls; which means that MSX-JE does not exist, accordingly.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("If above conditions are met, then")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("input 10H to D register, 0 to E register, header address of the")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("work area to HL register, slot no. which the work area is present")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("into B register. Then call address FFCAH. Be noted that, work")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("area should be placed on page 2 or 3, and stack should be placed")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("on page 3. Size of the work area is 64 bytes.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("If Japanese front end processors exist,")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("then value of HL will be incremented by 4, and following table")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("is originated. If there are 2 or more Japanese front end processors")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("connected, then equal number of tables are originated.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Former HL =>")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Capability vector")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Slot no.is not compatible.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("If bit 1 is 0, then virtual terminal")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("interface is exists. If 1, it does not exist.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("If bit 2 is 0, then dictionary interface")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("exists. If 1, it does not exist.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("If bit 3 is 0, then dictionary registration")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("and deletion function is available. If 1, they are not available.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Bits 4 to 7 are for future expansion,")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("and they are all fixed to 1 this point.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Check statuses of these bits to check")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("whether functions you want to use are there when you use MSX-JE.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("For example, a capability vector of VJE-80 (ASCII-made MSX-JE)")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("is F8H (dictionary cannot be changed), while VJE-80A (new version")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("of ASCII-made MSX-JE) is F0H (all functions described above are")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("available).")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Let your software to prompt a menu")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("and let users to select which MSX-JE they want to use if there")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("are 2 or more MSX-JEs. In some machines, MSX-JE embedded in the")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("machines always boots, thus negating the use of external MSX-JEs.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("For example, though you insert MSX-WRITE cartridge into a Panasonic")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("FS-4600F, internal MSX-JE is always chosen to be booted. :(")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Chapter 3 How to Use MSX-JE")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("To use MSX-JE, input value to registers,")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("and insterslot-call the aforementioned routines.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("However, you need to use rather uncommon")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("procedure to substitute character strings. I would like to explain")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("firstly.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("5.3.1 Format of Character Strings")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Format of character strings are;")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("[number of characters] + " + Chr(34) + "character")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("string" + Chr(34) + ".")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Character strings are in SHIFT-JIS format. For instance, 97H+" + Chr(34) + Chr(34) + "(" + Chr(34) + "red")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("balloon" + Chr(34) + "). Then, specify its header address to BC or DE register.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Zenkaku characters are always regarded as 2-bytes even if they")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("are not kanjis. Below are several examples.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("08H+" + Chr(34) + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("(" + Chr(34) + "red balloon" + Chr(34) + " in kanjis and kanas, 4 zenkaku characters")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("overall)")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("0DH+" + Chr(34) + Chr(34) + "(" + Chr(34) + "spaghetti")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("with fermented beans" + Chr(34) + ", 2 kanjis + 9 hankaku katakanas)")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("7H+" + Chr(34) + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("(" + Chr(34) + "club-house style sandwiches" + Chr(34) + ", 7 hankaku katakanas)")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("0EH+" + Chr(34) + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("(" + Chr(34) + "red balloon" + Chr(34) + " in 7 zenkaku hiraganas)")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("07H+" + Chr(34) + "TOUKYOU" + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("(7 hankaku characters)")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("1-byte accents (" + Chr(34) + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("and " + Chr(34) + Chr(34) + ")")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("are treated as single characters. You cannot treat hankaku hiraganas")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("(which are supported by MSX but not with PCs) and kanas which")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("are not supported by MSX in non-kanji modes - like " + Chr(34) + Chr(34) + ",")
  BiosCallsHelp_L(Chr(34) + Chr(34) + ",")
  BiosCallsHelp_L(Chr(34) + Chr(34) + ",")
  BiosCallsHelp_L(Chr(34) + Chr(34) + " or " + Chr(34) + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("- as hankaku characters and use them. Length of a character string")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("is 64 bytes at maximum.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Note on Japanese accents: Japanese")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("hiraganas and katakanas require 2 kind of " + Chr(34) + "accents" + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("to be added on upper-right of kana characters. They are essential")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("for recognition and pronunciation, and should not be omitted in")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("any cases.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("In non-kanji mode MSX, there are only")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("hiraganas and katakanas without accents, and these 2 accents (DEH")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("and DFH in ASCII) available, therefore you are required to represent")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("one accented kana using 2 characters. However, 2-byte characters")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("support both kanas with and without accents.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("5.3.2 MSX-JE Function Calls")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Inquiry (Function 01H)")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Input: 1 to A")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Output: MAX to HL")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("MIN to DE")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("MIN2 to BC")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("This returns necessary size of work")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("area to enable execution of MSX-JE. MAX is a maximum size of work")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("area. Even if you grant any more than MAX to MSX-JE, MSX-JE uses")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("only this size. Least necessary size goes into DE, while least")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("necessary size in case learning option is chosen goes into BC.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Value is counted by unit of bytes. For example, in case of VJE-80,")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("MAX=MIN2=3328 bytes and MIN=2304. In case of VJE-80A, MAX=MIN2=520")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("and MIN=512. In case of SONY JFEP, MAX=MIN=MIN2=2560.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("invoke (02H)")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Input: 2 to A")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Header address of BW to HL")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Length of BW to DE")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Output: None")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("This command allocates work area for")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("MSX-JE. You should call this whenever you boot MSX-JE. BW stands")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("for work area of MSX-JE. You should always allocate it in page")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("2 or 3. It seems that, several restrictions occur if you place")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("ASCII VJE-80 in page 2 and use it, but I do not think it's worth")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("being afraid of. You must check necessary length of work area")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("using function 1 (Inquiry) before calling this function. As a")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("point of fact, since MSX-JE never needs more than 2560 bytes as")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("its least necessary work area to boot, so it's OK if you allocate")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("2560 bytes.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("release (03H)")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Input: 3 to A")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Header address of BW to HL")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Output: None")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("This frees work area allocated for")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("MSX-JE. You should call this whenever you quit any program which")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("use MSX-JE. If you do not call this, learning dictionary might")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("be damaged.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("han_zen (40H)")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Input: 40H to A")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Address of BW to HL")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Address of source buffer (hankaku")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("character string) to DE")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Address of destination (zenkaku character")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("string) to BC")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Output: If A is 0, it means conversion")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("was successfully done.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("If A is other than 0 then conversion")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("was a failure. The value of A then stands for position of the")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("character that prevented the conversion, in buffer.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("This converts a hankaku character")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("string to a zenkaku character string. Both accents will be converted")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("into independent characters (though rarely used, 2-byte character")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("table does include accents as characters by their own).")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Example: Input 05H+" + Chr(34) + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("to DE")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Output 0AH+" + Chr(34) + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("to BC")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("zen_han (41H)")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Input: 41H to A")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Address of BW to HL")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Address of source buffer (zenkaku")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("character string) to DE")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Address of destination (hankaku character")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("string) to BC")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Output: If A is 0, it means conversion")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("was successfully done.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("IF A is other than 0 then conversion")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("was a failure. The value of A then stands for position of the")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("character that prevented the conversion, in buffer.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("This converts a zenkaku character")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("string to a hankaku character string. Both accents, which were")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("integrated as a single kana to a certain kana when they were zenkau,")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("will be converted into independent character.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Example: Input 058+" + Chr(34) + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("to DE")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Output 05H+" + Chr(34) + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("to BC")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("han_kata (42H)")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Input: 42H to A")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Address of BW to HL")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Address of source buffer (hankaku")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("character string) to DE")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Address of destination (katakana character")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("string) to BC")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Output: If A is 0, it means conversion")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("was successfully done.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("IF A is other than 0 then conversion")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("was a failure. The value of A then stands for position of the")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("character that prevented the conversion, in buffer.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("This converts a hankaku character")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("string into zenkaku katakana string. Input is expected to be katakanas")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("or romaji string.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Example: Input 07H+" + Chr(34) + "AKATUKA" + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("to DE")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Output 08H+" + Chr(34) + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("to BC")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("han_hira (43H)")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Input: 43H to A")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Address of BW to HL")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Address of source buffer (hankaku")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("character string) to DE")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Address of destination (hiragana character")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("string) to BC")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Output: If A is 0, it means conversion")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("was successfully done.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("IF A is other than 0 then conversion")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("was a failure. The value of A then stands for position of the")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("character that prevented the conversion, in buffer.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("This converts a hankaku character")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("string into zenkaku hiragana string. Input is expected to be in")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("katakanas (MSX 1-byte hiraganas are not accepted) or romaji string.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Example: Input 0AH+" + Chr(34) + "KAIRAKUENN" + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("to DE")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Output 08H+" + Chr(34) + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("to BC")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("kata_hira (44H)")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Input: 44H to A")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Address of BW to HL")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Address of source buffer (katakana")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("character string) to DE")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Address of destination (hiragana character")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("string) to BC")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Output: None.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("This converts a zenkaku katakana string")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("into zenkaku hiragana string. If input string included characters")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("other than zenkaku katakanas, that character will not be converted.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Conversion result is not certified if there were hankaku characters")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("in input string. :(")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Example: Input 0AH+" + Chr(34) + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("to DE")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Output 0AH+" + Chr(34) + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("to BC")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("kata_hira (45H)")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Input: 45H to A")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Address of BW to HL")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Address of source buffer (hiragana")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("character string) to DE")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Address of destination (katakana character")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("string) to BC")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Output: None.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Same as kata_hira, except in aspect")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("that this converts a zenkaku hiragana string into zenkaku katakana")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("string.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Example: Input 0AH+" + Chr(34) + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("to DE")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Output 0AH+" + Chr(34) + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("to BC")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("open_dic (46H)")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Users are not expected to call this.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("henkan1 (47H)")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Input: 47H to A")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Address of BW to HL")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Address of read data (zenkaku katakana")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("string)")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Output: If A=0, it means there is")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("no suitable candidate.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("If A is other than 0 then it is a")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("number of candidates for header bunsetsu")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("This converts a zenkaku katakana string")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("into a kanji+kana passage. Acquire the result through ji_koho")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("or other means.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Example: Input 10H+" + Chr(34) + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("to DE")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Output number of candidates for " + Chr(34) + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("to A")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("ji_koho (48H)")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Input: 48H to A")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Address of BW to HL")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Candidate buffer to DE")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Proceeding bunsetsu buffer to BC")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Output: If A=0, it means there is")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("no suitable candidate.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("If A is than 0 then it's a lot number")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("within a candidate block")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("This gets next candidate (jikoho)")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("for header bunsetsu. You must read with henkan1 to set the data")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("before you call this function.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Example: Suppose you called this function")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("after trying to convert an input " + Chr(34) + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("using henkan1.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Output: Lot number within a candidate")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("block to A")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("04H+" + Chr(34) + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("to DE")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("06H+" + Chr(34) + Chr(34))
  BiosCallsHelp_L("to BC")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("zen_koho (49H)")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Input: 49H to A")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Address of BW to HL")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Candidate buffer to DE")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Proceeding bunsetsu buffer to BC")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Output: If A=0, it means there is")
