  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("If A is than 0 then it's a lot number")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("within a candidate block")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("This gets prior candidate (zenkoho)")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("for header bunsetsu. You must read with henkan1 to set the data")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("before you call this function.")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("")
  BiosCallsHelp_L("Example: Suppose you tried to convert")
